{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112405","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112405/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112405/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112405/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112405","id":3589243016,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7V74CI","number":112405,"title":"Upgrading from 4.4 to 4.5 or 4.6 and reimporting results in defaulting GLTF naming to 4.0, resulting in renamed nodes.","user":{"login":"jitspoe","id":7751182,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTExODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751182?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe","html_url":"https://github.com/jitspoe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-11-05T04:35:33Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T10:14:41Z","closed_at":"2026-01-13T10:14:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4.1 -> v4.6.dev.custom_build [aeda8bc2a]\n\nSeems this issue also exists going from 4.4 to 4.5.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev (aeda8bc2a) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8115) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.95 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt seems there's a regression for this PR fix: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/80270\n\nCouldn't find the original issue, if there was one, so I'm making a new one.  In short, \"2\" is being appended to nodes after import when it wasn't before:\n\n<img width=\"228\" height=\"137\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2356ecdc-57ce-4a4f-8bc1-df45c5ada4d4\" />\n\nI assume this is because the base node is also called \"shotgun\" here.  Effectively all the meshes that have the same name as the filename have lost their materials in my project.\n\nEdit: This seems to be due to the the fact that .import files do not contain \"gltf/naming_version\", so it defaults to 0, which is the 4.0 naming, which had the issue of appending 2 to some nodes that had the same name.  Changing the naming version in the import settings and reimporting will fix the issue.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Make a project in 4.4.1.\n- Add a blend file with a mesh that has the same name as the filename (ex \"cube\" for cube.blend).\n- Create a new inherited scene from the blend file and assign a material to the mesh.\n- Open the project in 4.6\n- Reimport the .blend file\n- Note that the material has been lost and the mesh has been renamed.\n\nI did not notice this problem earlier as I hadn't reimported older meshes, but something about 4.6 broke animations requiring a mass re-import, and a lot of materials broke for me.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[blender-import-rename.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23350520/blender-import-rename.zip)\n\nNote that if you open the project in 4.4.1, the cube is blue.  If you open it in 4.6, the material is lost.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112405/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112405/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}